1
00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:43,990
[Small Town Remedy]

2
00:01:44,170 --> 00:01:46,870
[Episode 10]

3
00:01:50,350 --> 00:01:51,610
Our daughter, Ai Chen,

4
00:01:52,039 --> 00:01:53,920
has already taken a fancy to you.

5
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,590
Why don't you

6
00:01:56,590 --> 00:01:57,710
like her?

7
00:02:23,190 --> 00:02:24,000
Kid.

8
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:27,400
Our family

9
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,400
is indeed no ordinary one.

10
00:02:31,710 --> 00:02:33,560
Dating Ai Chen

11
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:37,520
comes with pressure for sure.

12
00:02:38,150 --> 00:02:39,870
But as a young man,

13
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,660
you must have the courage
to face difficulties.

14
00:02:44,079 --> 00:02:45,360
You can't let

15
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,960
an "evil" father-in-law

16
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,329
and an "unreasonable" mother-in-law...

17
00:02:56,079 --> 00:02:57,590
make you back down, huh?

18
00:02:59,310 --> 00:03:00,520
Our Ai Chen is

19
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:04,190
fair-skinned and gorgeous, has long legs,

20
00:03:04,190 --> 00:03:06,590
makes good money,
and cares for the family.

21
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,520
How could you possibly not like her?

22
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:10,050
It just doesn't make sense.

23
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,360
Love

24
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,400
makes people blind.

25
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:20,610
You should calm down and think it through.

26
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,630
Are you really not into her,

27
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:26,220
or are you just too afraid to admit

28
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:28,170
your feelings for her?

29
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:35,690
Zhengliang.

30
00:03:37,710 --> 00:03:38,240
We're at work.

31
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,700
Why are you chatting here?

32
00:03:40,190 --> 00:03:42,190
President Long wants to talk to you.

33
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,910
Come on! What are you dawdling for?

34
00:03:55,910 --> 00:03:57,240
He's about to lose it.

35
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:09,960
Go ahead.

36
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:31,600
That's it?

37
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,930
What else do you expect?

38
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,510
Well...

39
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,510
Where is President Long?

40
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:43,750
Isn't he about to lose it?

41
00:04:43,750 --> 00:04:45,360
It's not about the President losing it.

42
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,240
If we hadn't called you back,

43
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,360
San and Si would have given you hell.

44
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:50,720
One punch from San,

45
00:04:51,070 --> 00:04:52,870
and you'd probably be torn apart.

46
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:53,310
Tell me,

47
00:04:53,310 --> 00:04:53,870
if I didn't help you

48
00:04:53,870 --> 00:04:55,040
make this narrow escape,

49
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,040
who else could?

50
00:04:56,750 --> 00:04:58,070
How are you going to thank me?

51
00:04:58,070 --> 00:04:58,870
And us.

52
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,260
Treat us to a meal, huh?

53
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,280
Thank you.

54
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,800
That's improvement.

55
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:13,750
He's learned some manners
and knows how to say thanks.

56
00:05:13,750 --> 00:05:14,800
He's just scared.

57
00:05:16,110 --> 00:05:19,570
[Fucheng North Station]

58
00:05:18,870 --> 00:05:20,920
Usually, I'm the one seeing others off.

59
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:21,680
It's finally my turn

60
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,740
to leave this time.

61
00:05:22,870 --> 00:05:24,730
You're getting quite emotional.

62
00:05:26,270 --> 00:05:28,730
Actually, you didn't
have to come see me off.

63
00:05:29,190 --> 00:05:31,120
No matter how much we fight,
we're still brothers.

64
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,600
That's one in tens of thousands chance,

65
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,240
remember?

66
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,950
Hurry up. They're checking tickets.

67
00:05:37,950 --> 00:05:39,000
Don't drag your feet.

68
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,630
Call me when you reach Beijing,

69
00:05:40,630 --> 00:05:41,390
got it?

70
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:42,360
I'm leaving.

71
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,740
H-Hurry... Go ahead. Stop dawdling.

72
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,240
Well, then... Um...

73
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,800
What's wrong?

74
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,510
Do you have my ID card?

75
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,120
How could I have it?

76
00:06:08,070 --> 00:06:09,160
-Chen...
-Why are you looking at me?

77
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,690
I definitely don't have it.

78
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:12,070
I've still got work to do.

79
00:06:12,070 --> 00:06:12,830
I'm heading back.

80
00:06:12,830 --> 00:06:14,290
Take your time finding it.

81
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,190
Oh no, my ID card is gone.

82
00:06:18,190 --> 00:06:18,920
Calm down.

83
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:19,850
It can't be lost.

84
00:06:19,990 --> 00:06:22,190
Check your bag and suitcase carefully.

85
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:23,510
If you really can't find it,

86
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:24,120
just apply

87
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,450
for a temporary ID card.

88
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:28,050
There are even temporary ID cards?

89
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,870
I got it, but the train has departed.

90
00:06:36,870 --> 00:06:37,560
What should I do now?

91
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,560
It's fine.
Go to the ticket counter over there

92
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,820
and buy the earliest ticket.

93
00:06:40,820 --> 00:06:43,220
[Exit]

94
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,270
Well,

95
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:52,630
I want to buy a ticket to Beijing.

96
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:53,690
Are there any left?

97
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:57,430
Tickets in the presale period

98
00:06:57,430 --> 00:06:58,159
are all sold out.

99
00:06:58,159 --> 00:06:59,560
The earliest is in 3 days.

100
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:06,970
I'm done for.

101
00:07:07,630 --> 00:07:08,630
What did they say?

102
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,950
They said tickets
within the presale period

103
00:07:11,950 --> 00:07:12,950
were all sold out.

104
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,170
I have to wait 3 days.

105
00:07:14,270 --> 00:07:14,830
Yeah,

106
00:07:14,830 --> 00:07:16,490
I also saw no tickets on my app.

107
00:07:18,390 --> 00:07:20,790
See? You really have no social experience.

108
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:22,240
You haven't even left your hometown,

109
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,900
and you're already losing it.

110
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,160
Stop nagging.

111
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,560
I'm starting to be less confident
in myself.

112
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,800
Stop it.

113
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,960
You only wasted a ticket.

114
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:35,000
There's no other choice.

115
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,750
You'll have to leave in a few days.

116
00:07:36,750 --> 00:07:37,390
Go home first.

117
00:07:37,390 --> 00:07:38,390
I'm going to work.

118
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:44,190
You... You told me to find

119
00:07:44,390 --> 00:07:45,190
another job

120
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:46,390
in Fucheng last time.

121
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:48,690
What kind of job should I look for?

122
00:07:49,430 --> 00:07:51,600
This family is from Liaozhong.

123
00:07:51,870 --> 00:07:53,159
It's a custom back in their hometown

124
00:07:53,159 --> 00:07:54,310
to cry and circle the coffin 18 times.

125
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:55,360
Can you arrange it?

126
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,680
Why not?

127
00:07:56,870 --> 00:07:58,530
We have to follow their rules.

128
00:08:07,870 --> 00:08:09,240
Didn't Zhengguang go to Beijing?

129
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:09,950
Why is his ID card

130
00:08:09,950 --> 00:08:10,920
here with you?

131
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:12,560
Well...

132
00:08:12,750 --> 00:08:14,210
He said he was not in a hurry

133
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,430
and would leave in a few days.

134
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:16,630
Let's l-load the car.

135
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:17,390
Hurry up.

136
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,540
That's all, right?

137
00:08:19,630 --> 00:08:20,310
Yeah.

138
00:08:20,310 --> 00:08:20,870
Let's go!

139
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,870
Stop scrolling on your phone.

140
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:23,680
Mind your step.

141
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,870
You're so bossy.

142
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:41,549
Mr. Long.

143
00:08:44,270 --> 00:08:45,080
It's fine.

144
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:52,870
You want to be a gofer at our hospital?

145
00:08:53,670 --> 00:08:54,080
Yep.

146
00:08:54,510 --> 00:08:57,030
I don't need a formal position.
Pay me whatever you see fit.

147
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:57,510
I don't need

148
00:08:57,510 --> 00:08:59,570
to give you a gift for this job, right?

149
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:03,240
We'll talk about it after it's done.

150
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:11,360
But you have to tell me why.

151
00:09:12,630 --> 00:09:14,200
You don't actually like mopping floors

152
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,860
and cleaning toilets, do you?

153
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:17,670
I just want to find him a job

154
00:09:17,670 --> 00:09:19,120
that he can do

155
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,630
to support himself.

156
00:09:20,630 --> 00:09:21,790
Let me speak for myself.

157
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:22,600
Mr. Long,

158
00:09:22,790 --> 00:09:24,480
I can do any dirty or drudgery work.

159
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,720
I just want to see

160
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,750
how well I can handle stress.

161
00:09:31,870 --> 00:09:34,000
I actually have a better place for you.

162
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,590
[Emergency Surgery Department]

163
00:09:40,590 --> 00:09:45,220
[Gastric Lavage Room]

164
00:09:52,890 --> 00:09:55,770
[Storage]

165
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:07,750
[Quiet]

166
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,410
Hello, President Long.

167
00:10:34,790 --> 00:10:36,320
What brings you here today?

168
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,120
Is Mr. Wu here?

169
00:10:40,630 --> 00:10:41,690
Mr. Wu is upstairs.

170
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:43,520
Do you need me to show you the way?

171
00:10:44,150 --> 00:10:44,840
No, thanks.

172
00:10:45,030 --> 00:10:45,670
Alright.

173
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,570
Hi, President Long.

174
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,050
Hello, Mr. Long!

175
00:11:01,750 --> 00:11:02,680
President Long.

176
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,290
President Long.

177
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:31,990
[Flower of Wealth]

178
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:52,030
Man, you're pretty muscular.

179
00:11:53,270 --> 00:11:55,070
Alright, come to work tomorrow.

180
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,240
The base salary is 3,000 yuan.

181
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,270
And if you do well,

182
00:11:57,270 --> 00:11:58,480
your bonus can exceed 10,000 yuan.

183
00:11:58,480 --> 00:11:59,120
How's it?

184
00:11:59,120 --> 00:11:59,870
That much?

185
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:02,570
Maybe I didn't make myself clear just now.

186
00:12:03,510 --> 00:12:04,670
He'll only work as a waiter

187
00:12:04,670 --> 00:12:05,630
for 10 days,

188
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:06,630
like an intern.

189
00:12:06,750 --> 00:12:08,600
Hey, Big Brother, are you kidding me?

190
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:10,550
Who does an internship at KTV?

191
00:12:11,630 --> 00:12:14,000
Zhengliang is the junior I value the most.

192
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:17,000
Zhengguang is his little brother,

193
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,530
who's never suffered much.

194
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,730
It's just for him to toughen up.

195
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:24,390
Just... for him to toughen up?

196
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,080
Alright, Big Brother,

197
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,210
let's do as you said.

198
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:32,250
It's just a waste of his potential.

199
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:34,750
Jie,

200
00:12:34,790 --> 00:12:35,790
come to my office.

201
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,420
He's your little brother?

202
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:43,240
May I have your surname?

203
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,030
Liu.

204
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:45,390
Well,

205
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:48,120
Dr. Liu, which department

206
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,840
in the hospital are you
the chief physician of?

207
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:53,240
The associate one of the Emergency
and Neurosurgical Depts.

208
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,200
Young and promising.

209
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:03,000
Boss, what's up? Are we going to war?

210
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,030
Our men are ready!

211
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:06,080
What... What war?

212
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,080
W-Who are we going to fight?

213
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,940
What... What do you mean by "war"?

214
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,840
W-We've got guests here!

215
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:12,510
What... What are you doing?

216
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,480
Mind your manners.

217
00:13:15,870 --> 00:13:16,670
Um...

218
00:13:18,510 --> 00:13:19,840
W-What's your name again?

219
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,510
Zhengguang.

220
00:13:20,510 --> 00:13:21,910
Right, yes, Zhengguang.

221
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:24,360
He's Chief Physician Liu's little brother.

222
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,790
Big Brother Long introduced him here.

223
00:13:25,790 --> 00:13:26,670
He'll be interning here

224
00:13:26,670 --> 00:13:27,320
for just 10 days.

225
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,320
You'll guide him.

226
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:29,960
Okay.

227
00:13:30,510 --> 00:13:31,320
Come with me!

228
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:34,090
-Where am I going?
-Go with him.

229
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:35,510
Wait.

230
00:13:36,390 --> 00:13:37,200
President.

231
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:38,840
Don't worry.

232
00:13:39,150 --> 00:13:39,960
Go.

233
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:40,910
No worries.

234
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,320
It's fine.

235
00:13:43,750 --> 00:13:44,550
Big Brother.

236
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:45,910
Well...

237
00:13:47,670 --> 00:13:49,750
Um, can I discuss something with you?

238
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,600
Business has been

239
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:54,030
really rough lately.

240
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:56,670
Well, Big Brother, could you give me

241
00:13:56,670 --> 00:13:57,670
a little more time

242
00:13:57,670 --> 00:13:59,800
to pay this quarter's protection fee?

243
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,280
Please, Big Brother.

244
00:14:03,390 --> 00:14:04,200
Big Brother.

245
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:05,750
No.

246
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,680
Come on, Big Brother.

247
00:14:15,390 --> 00:14:16,070
Be gentle.

248
00:14:16,070 --> 00:14:16,630
Something's

249
00:14:16,630 --> 00:14:17,600
wrong with my brain, you know?

250
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,660
Be gentle, please.

251
00:14:25,790 --> 00:14:26,650
Come back here.

252
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:35,100
Take off your clothes.

253
00:14:35,550 --> 00:14:38,120
Bro, why do I need to take off my clothes?

254
00:14:43,910 --> 00:14:45,360
To change into your uniform.

255
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,790
What are you afraid of?

256
00:14:48,670 --> 00:14:50,600
We run a legitimate business here.

257
00:14:50,750 --> 00:14:52,120
I just heard the boss say

258
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:54,550
the bonus could be over 10,000 yuan
if I do well.

259
00:14:54,550 --> 00:14:57,080
It doesn't sound
like a legitimate business.

260
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,670
Mr. Wu meant for you

261
00:14:58,670 --> 00:14:59,960
to be his assistant.

262
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,630
He has a special hobby.

263
00:15:03,390 --> 00:15:04,840
You'll find out later.

264
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:15,440
Mr. Wu...

265
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:16,500
Mr. Wu is a good guy.

266
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:18,390
He just has a quirk.

267
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:20,530
[Quiet]

268
00:15:18,390 --> 00:15:19,850
He likes to play gangster.

269
00:15:20,630 --> 00:15:21,270
He's hired a few

270
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:22,930
young guys of similar height.

271
00:15:23,150 --> 00:15:24,480
They do nothing

272
00:15:24,630 --> 00:15:25,550
but wear black suits

273
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:27,080
and wander around with him.

274
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:28,870
Half the money he makes

275
00:15:28,870 --> 00:15:30,530
is spent on the show he puts on.

276
00:15:33,270 --> 00:15:34,080
And he insists on calling

277
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:36,080
the rent I collect a protection fee.

278
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,360
He's just watched too many gangster movies

279
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,490
and got influenced.

280
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:41,270
Then just now, that...

281
00:15:41,270 --> 00:15:44,000
That manager talked about
going to war and something.

282
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:44,840
A price war.

283
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:47,480
Twenty-eight yuan for 3 hours of singing,

284
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:48,790
with free beer and popcorn.

285
00:15:48,790 --> 00:15:49,670
This is insane.

286
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,900
That's really an eye-opener.

287
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,320
A certain environment

288
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:56,080
[Passage Only for Medical Staff]

289
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,270
raises a certain kind of people.

290
00:15:55,270 --> 00:15:56,790
You can't blame it on the environment.

291
00:15:56,790 --> 00:15:59,080
You won't find another place like this
in Fucheng.

292
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,120
I'm going to work.

293
00:16:03,670 --> 00:16:04,510
I did you a favor.

294
00:16:04,510 --> 00:16:06,510
Aren't you going to return one to me?

295
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:10,080
You didn't say
there were conditions beforehand.

296
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:11,030
Don't be nervous.

297
00:16:11,030 --> 00:16:12,760
It has something to do with you.

298
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,200
Go to Daoxi Photo Studio

299
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,600
and take several photos.

300
00:16:15,670 --> 00:16:16,730
What? Take photos?

301
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:17,910
For what?

302
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,750
To update
the hospital's promotional materials.

303
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:22,280
Everyone above deputy senior
has taken them.

304
00:16:25,550 --> 00:16:26,080
This is enough.

305
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,280
You're taking it now?

306
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,580
Check the lighting first.

307
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:32,240
Stay still. Keep your head up.

308
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,440
Look straight ahead.

309
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,440
You look way too serious.

310
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,720
Give me a smile.

311
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:41,750
This is too fake.

312
00:16:41,750 --> 00:16:42,600
Smile.

313
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:44,670
Take your hands out of your pockets.

314
00:16:44,670 --> 00:16:45,840
Think of a pose.

315
00:16:46,030 --> 00:16:47,000
How about this?

316
00:16:47,550 --> 00:16:48,440
Or this?

317
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,080
Better put them down.

318
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,600
Better put your hands down.

319
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:52,440
Just do this.

320
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:53,600
Relax a bit.

321
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:59,080
The whole lighting is a bit too white.

322
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:00,410
Give him...

323
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:08,829
Hello.

324
00:17:26,069 --> 00:17:26,880
San.

325
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:28,740
Come over here.

326
00:17:30,350 --> 00:17:31,350
They're all here.

327
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:35,030
Take this.

328
00:17:35,110 --> 00:17:36,510
Alright, this is enough.

329
00:17:37,750 --> 00:17:38,750
Where's your mom?

330
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,130
In the back, I guess.

331
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:43,640
-It‘s 78.4 yuan in total.
-Amy.

332
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:44,790
I paid for this one back there inside.

333
00:17:44,790 --> 00:17:45,350
-Yes.
-Let's go.

334
00:17:45,350 --> 00:17:46,310
That'll be 78 yuan, please.

335
00:17:46,310 --> 00:17:47,110
Okay.

336
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:48,720
Mom.

337
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:49,480
Let me carry it.

338
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:50,280
Where to scan?

339
00:17:50,510 --> 00:17:51,160
Oh, over there.

340
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,090
J-Just a minute.

341
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:54,480
There we go.

342
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:55,880
Just a second.

343
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:56,830
Let me pay.

344
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:58,240
Received 100 yuan. Let me give you change.

345
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,570
We paid you in cash, huh?

346
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:01,640
I haven't given you change yet.

347
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:02,400
Let me give you change.

348
00:18:02,400 --> 00:18:03,110
No, no need.

349
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:14,510
Amy.

350
00:18:15,350 --> 00:18:17,480
I want to talk to you about something.

351
00:18:19,830 --> 00:18:22,880
[1314 Funeral Services]

352
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:21,550
Well,

353
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:22,590
can we

354
00:18:23,070 --> 00:18:25,200
not grab other people's things again?

355
00:18:26,510 --> 00:18:27,960
Tell me what you like,

356
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:29,640
and I'll buy it for you, okay?

357
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:35,720
What do you mean?

358
00:18:38,590 --> 00:18:40,000
You think I'm embarrassing, don't you?

359
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,130
I've been like this since I was little.

360
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,440
When you met me,

361
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:46,270
you knew I liked...

362
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,160
to grab things.

363
00:18:48,310 --> 00:18:50,240
I didn't see you run away back then.

364
00:18:50,590 --> 00:18:51,590
When I was young,

365
00:18:51,590 --> 00:18:52,680
y-you made me

366
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:54,110
lose my mind.

367
00:18:55,830 --> 00:18:57,000
As the saying goes,

368
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:59,200
love makes people lose their minds.

369
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:01,270
I loved you so much that...

370
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:03,480
I... I totally lost my mind.

371
00:19:03,790 --> 00:19:04,790
The more you say, the wilder you get.

372
00:19:04,790 --> 00:19:05,790
How dare you pick on me?

373
00:19:05,790 --> 00:19:07,390
-What's wrong with me?
-Amy.

374
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:11,310
We can cure the problem.

375
00:19:11,310 --> 00:19:12,510
What's there to cure?

376
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:13,790
Cure yourself.

377
00:19:14,030 --> 00:19:14,880
I'm not sick.

378
00:19:19,230 --> 00:19:21,800
[1314 Funeral Services]

379
00:19:24,110 --> 00:19:26,030
Okay, a little to the left. To the left.

380
00:19:26,030 --> 00:19:27,430
A little more to the left.

381
00:19:27,750 --> 00:19:29,240
Alright, hang it.

382
00:19:32,110 --> 00:19:34,560
[Liu Zhengliang, Celebrity Chief Physician
[Emergency Department]

383
00:19:34,160 --> 00:19:35,960
On the left, that corner on the left.

384
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:37,160
Smooth that corner out.

385
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:38,360
Right at that corner.

386
00:19:39,220 --> 00:19:43,210
[Liu Zhengliang, Celebrity Chief Physician
[Emergency Department]

387
00:19:39,590 --> 00:19:40,440
Okay, the left is fine now.

388
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:41,310
Now the right side.

389
00:19:41,310 --> 00:19:42,590
Smooth out that corner on the right.

390
00:19:42,590 --> 00:19:43,110
On the right.

391
00:19:43,110 --> 00:19:45,270
Look, his smile is quite cute.

392
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:46,270
Yeah.

393
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:47,600
He's quite handsome.

394
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:48,890
Okay, that's good.

395
00:19:51,820 --> 00:19:55,770
[1314 Funeral Services]

396
00:20:07,650 --> 00:20:10,970
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

397
00:20:12,510 --> 00:20:13,790
Good morning, Chief Physician Liu.

398
00:20:13,370 --> 00:20:15,190
[Exit]

399
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:15,750
Chief Physician Liu.

400
00:20:15,190 --> 00:20:17,690
[Security Duty Room]

401
00:20:18,790 --> 00:20:20,050
Good morning, Dr. Liu.

402
00:20:21,290 --> 00:20:25,190
[Treating patients with skill
and compassion]

403
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:23,680
Dr. Liu.

404
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:24,720
You're here.

405
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:25,480
Come in.

406
00:20:27,680 --> 00:20:28,480
Wait for me.

407
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:34,920
Chief Physician Liu,

408
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,440
I'm Chen Sheng
from the Gastroenterology Department.

409
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:37,370
Nice to meet you.

410
00:20:39,310 --> 00:20:41,510
I'm Wu from the Proctology Department.

411
00:20:43,750 --> 00:20:44,550
Who is he?

412
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:46,030
The one who saved the patient

413
00:20:46,030 --> 00:20:47,070
with a crushed skull.

414
00:20:47,070 --> 00:20:49,730
The one whose photo
is hanging on the outer wall.

415
00:20:50,550 --> 00:20:52,110
Hello, Chief Physician Liu.

416
00:20:52,110 --> 00:20:54,910
I'm Zhang
from the Medical Insurance Department.

417
00:21:10,110 --> 00:21:11,570
I was just looking for you.

418
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:13,440
You still had the guts to look for me?

419
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:15,160
What's wrong? Did I offend you again?

420
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:16,160
Stop pretending.

421
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:17,400
What's going on with my photo

422
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:18,330
at the entrance?

423
00:21:19,030 --> 00:21:20,030
It's a good thing.

424
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,400
Didn't expect

425
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:23,530
Xiaoximen Hospital

426
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:25,200
to promote you

427
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:26,240
so well, huh?

428
00:21:26,590 --> 00:21:28,160
It's no worse than in big cities, right?

429
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:29,560
You call this promotion?

430
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:30,850
What did you tell me?

431
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:31,510
You told me that

432
00:21:31,510 --> 00:21:33,070
everyone above deputy senior
took the photos.

433
00:21:33,070 --> 00:21:33,550
Why is it

434
00:21:33,550 --> 00:21:35,150
only my photo hanging there?

435
00:21:35,440 --> 00:21:37,100
Yes, they all took the photos.

436
00:21:37,830 --> 00:21:39,750
Yours was chosen from the crowd
to be put on the wall.

437
00:21:39,750 --> 00:21:40,880
Why are you unhappy with it?

438
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,270
Why would I be happy?

439
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:43,920
I'll leave in at most

440
00:21:43,920 --> 00:21:44,830
a month or so.

441
00:21:44,830 --> 00:21:45,920
This is fraud.

442
00:21:46,590 --> 00:21:48,440
So what if you'll leave in a month or so?

443
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:49,200
As everyone says,

444
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:51,030
it takes 21 days to form a habit.

445
00:21:51,030 --> 00:21:52,070
A month is enough.

446
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:53,720
Besides,

447
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:55,030
in this small place,

448
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:57,160
the locals

449
00:21:57,350 --> 00:21:58,680
take a walk 3 times a day

450
00:21:58,750 --> 00:22:00,610
and pass by Xiaoximen every time.

451
00:22:00,920 --> 00:22:02,440
Don't you think this can

452
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:04,110
promote you well?

453
00:22:06,550 --> 00:22:08,410
You tricked me. That's one thing.

454
00:22:08,640 --> 00:22:10,720
But you're also tricking the patients?

455
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:12,350
I'm not a chief doctor at all!

456
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:13,970
This is false advertising.

457
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:16,680
You're the associate chief physician

458
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:18,160
of the Emergency and Neurosurgical Depts,

459
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:20,960
approved unanimously
by the hospital committee.

460
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:23,110
Same work,
with your title promoted by 2 ranks

461
00:22:23,110 --> 00:22:24,030
and your salary doubled.

462
00:22:24,030 --> 00:22:25,090
Happy to hear that?

463
00:22:25,110 --> 00:22:25,920
Happy...

464
00:22:26,550 --> 00:22:27,240
Why... Why would I...

465
00:22:27,240 --> 00:22:29,040
Why would I be happy? Seriously?

466
00:22:29,510 --> 00:22:30,880
Everyone is laughing at me.

467
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:31,720
Everyone's

468
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:33,240
just happy for you.

469
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:35,040
What do you mean laughing at you?

470
00:22:36,750 --> 00:22:38,680
Tell me, if you were in Shenzhen,

471
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:41,550
would there be so many people

472
00:22:41,550 --> 00:22:43,110
genuinely feeling happy for you?

473
00:22:43,110 --> 00:22:43,920
Hey...

474
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:48,720
I... I'm telling you,

475
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:49,510
this is...

476
00:22:49,880 --> 00:22:50,590
This is an infringement

477
00:22:50,590 --> 00:22:51,400
of my portrait rights.

478
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:52,600
I can sue you for this!

479
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:54,810
Go back and look through the contract.

480
00:22:55,400 --> 00:22:56,680
The portrait rights during your employment

481
00:22:56,680 --> 00:22:58,540
belong entirely to the hospital.

482
00:22:58,590 --> 00:22:59,400
I will.

483
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:01,680
I have to look through it carefully.

484
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:02,750
I'll read it very carefully.

485
00:23:02,750 --> 00:23:04,440
I'm going to read it right away.

486
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:05,920
I know it's hard for you to accept

487
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:08,050
such a massive promotional campaign.

488
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:10,030
But why do we have to do this?

489
00:23:11,310 --> 00:23:12,510
We just don't want to hide the fact

490
00:23:12,510 --> 00:23:13,550
that Xiaoximen Hospital

491
00:23:13,550 --> 00:23:14,830
has such an excellent surgeon

492
00:23:14,830 --> 00:23:15,920
like you.

493
00:23:20,750 --> 00:23:22,150
The country trained you,

494
00:23:22,350 --> 00:23:23,550
and it's your destiny

495
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,510
to shine and help as many patients

496
00:23:25,510 --> 00:23:26,640
as you can.

497
00:23:43,830 --> 00:23:44,640
Mingming.

498
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:49,850
You graduated
from our province's medical university?

499
00:23:50,480 --> 00:23:52,110
I also got my bachelor's degree there.

500
00:23:52,110 --> 00:23:53,240
What class were you?

501
00:23:53,830 --> 00:23:55,310
Class of 2011, clinical medicine.

502
00:23:55,310 --> 00:23:56,370
I was Class of 2009.

503
00:23:58,550 --> 00:24:00,680
Why do I have no impression of you?

504
00:24:00,790 --> 00:24:02,030
Do you know me?

505
00:24:03,590 --> 00:24:04,480
I know you.

506
00:24:05,430 --> 00:24:06,680
I only focused on studying,

507
00:24:06,680 --> 00:24:07,480
unlike you,

508
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:08,720
who was in the student union

509
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:09,640
and even formed a band,

510
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:10,770
always showing off.

511
00:24:11,030 --> 00:24:12,760
You have some impression of me.

512
00:24:15,960 --> 00:24:17,480
Big star, Chief Physician Liu,

513
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:18,340
what happened?

514
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:23,000
What's wrong?

515
00:24:30,750 --> 00:24:33,000
There really is a portrait rights clause.

516
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:34,790
What a cunning old man.

517
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:37,530
You got tricked by Mr. Long?

518
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:39,290
Then trick him back.

519
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:41,510
No way.

520
00:24:41,830 --> 00:24:43,480
I've got to check in on Zhang Jiao.

521
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:44,510
If she doesn't wake up soon,

522
00:24:44,510 --> 00:24:45,110
who knows what

523
00:24:45,110 --> 00:24:47,110
other dirty tricks are awaiting me.

524
00:24:47,270 --> 00:24:48,240
Do you need my help?

525
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:49,300
Just eat your food.

526
00:24:52,200 --> 00:24:53,000
Mingming,

527
00:24:53,440 --> 00:24:55,770
do you remember what my signature song was

528
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:57,960
when I was in school?

529
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:00,680
"Too Softhearted."

530
00:25:00,680 --> 00:25:02,310
And also "Sad Pacific."

531
00:25:03,920 --> 00:25:05,000
I've heard them all,

532
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,200
but I don't like them.

533
00:25:08,550 --> 00:25:10,200
I can sing English songs, too.

534
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:11,530
"Take Me to Your Heart."

535
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:16,800
My spoken English is not bad.

536
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:18,930
Let me know if you need help.

537
00:25:23,370 --> 00:25:24,370
[KTV Flower of Wealth]

538
00:25:28,720 --> 00:25:29,510
Come in.

539
00:25:32,310 --> 00:25:33,270
Come here, young man.

540
00:25:33,270 --> 00:25:34,870
Come sing with me for a while.

541
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:36,790
What?

542
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:41,400
My husband passed away half a year ago,

543
00:25:41,920 --> 00:25:43,980
right at Xiaoximen Hospital nearby.

544
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:47,220
I've been dreaming about him lately.

545
00:25:47,790 --> 00:25:49,640
I dare not stay alone anymore.

546
00:25:49,880 --> 00:25:51,270
I've got a heart condition.

547
00:25:51,270 --> 00:25:52,030
I'm scared.

548
00:25:52,640 --> 00:25:53,790
Madam, you should see a doctor

549
00:25:53,790 --> 00:25:55,160
at the hospital for your heart condition.

550
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:56,480
Why are you turning to me?

551
00:25:56,480 --> 00:25:57,350
No doctor.

552
00:25:57,350 --> 00:25:58,480
I don't like any doctor. Come with me.

553
00:25:58,480 --> 00:25:59,550
I just like you.

554
00:25:59,750 --> 00:26:00,480
Come on,

555
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:01,680
just sing with me for a while.

556
00:26:01,680 --> 00:26:02,640
What's the big deal?

557
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:03,720
Just for a while, okay?

558
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:04,400
You just...

559
00:26:04,400 --> 00:26:05,590
You look exactly like my husband

560
00:26:05,590 --> 00:26:06,790
when he was young.

561
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:08,350
Just think of it as helping me

562
00:26:08,350 --> 00:26:10,350
make up for my regrets from my youth,

563
00:26:10,350 --> 00:26:11,110
okay?

564
00:26:40,850 --> 00:26:43,810
[Xiaoximen Hospital,
the guardian of your health]

565
00:26:53,590 --> 00:26:55,270
Your condition is related to stress.

566
00:26:55,270 --> 00:27:01,060
[Wishing You a Speedy Recovery]

567
00:26:55,390 --> 00:26:56,720
Please stay calm.

568
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:57,400
Try not to get upset

569
00:26:57,400 --> 00:26:58,110
with your family, huh?

570
00:26:58,110 --> 00:26:58,550
Okay.

571
00:26:58,550 --> 00:26:59,070
Be careful.

572
00:26:59,070 --> 00:26:59,960
Be careful when you walk.

573
00:26:59,960 --> 00:27:00,960
When will Chief Physician Liu come?

574
00:27:00,960 --> 00:27:01,750
You have to wait a while.

575
00:27:01,750 --> 00:27:03,000
How about you wait outside first?

