It could be laziness,

859
00:37:13,590 --> 00:37:14,990
or it could be an illness.

860
00:37:16,280 --> 00:37:18,190
Whatever illness you say it is.

861
00:37:18,880 --> 00:37:20,480
So how do you plan to treat me?

862
00:37:25,550 --> 00:37:26,360
I suggest you register

863
00:37:26,360 --> 00:37:27,510
with the Ophthalmology Department

864
00:37:27,510 --> 00:37:28,710
and Neurology Department.

865
00:37:28,710 --> 00:37:29,230
This is not

866
00:37:29,230 --> 00:37:31,440
what our Emergency Department can handle.

867
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:33,370
I've got a patient waiting in line.

868
00:37:37,070 --> 00:37:37,880
Okay.

869
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:40,540
Then let me ask you

870
00:37:40,560 --> 00:37:41,620
one last question.

871
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:42,590
Do you mind

872
00:37:42,590 --> 00:37:44,450
your partner's education level?

873
00:37:47,850 --> 00:37:48,590
Come on, sir.

874
00:37:48,590 --> 00:37:49,720
What's the problem?

875
00:37:50,110 --> 00:37:50,880
Go away.

876
00:37:50,880 --> 00:37:51,320
W-What's the rush?

877
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:52,320
Leave me alone.

878
00:37:54,190 --> 00:37:56,070
Will it kill you to answer?

879
00:38:01,480 --> 00:38:02,880
Focus on your work first.

880
00:38:04,320 --> 00:38:05,980
I'll wait for you to clock out.

881
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:08,410
Go ahead.

882
00:38:12,710 --> 00:38:13,440
Doctor.

883
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:19,000
I have a brother.

884
00:38:20,480 --> 00:38:22,190
He got a weird disease before,

885
00:38:22,840 --> 00:38:24,100
and it was quite scary.

886
00:38:24,400 --> 00:38:27,460
The whole village said
he was possessed by evil things.

887
00:38:27,710 --> 00:38:29,230
My mom got really worked up

888
00:38:29,360 --> 00:38:31,230
because she firmly opposed

889
00:38:31,230 --> 00:38:32,510
superstition.

890
00:38:32,510 --> 00:38:34,030
So she told me, since I was little,

891
00:38:34,030 --> 00:38:35,880
not to hang out with people

892
00:38:35,880 --> 00:38:36,740
engaging in it.

893
00:38:46,760 --> 00:38:47,630
So, Mr. Wu,

894
00:38:48,670 --> 00:38:50,000
I want to resign.

895
00:38:50,630 --> 00:38:52,490
President Long and I are friends.

896
00:38:52,510 --> 00:38:54,640
We've known each other for a long time.

897
00:38:55,710 --> 00:38:56,880
I don't even remember when

898
00:38:56,880 --> 00:38:57,550
the first time was

899
00:38:57,550 --> 00:38:58,710
that he invited me to his place

900
00:38:58,710 --> 00:38:59,710
for coffee.

901
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:03,590
You're asking to leave at this time.

902
00:39:03,590 --> 00:39:06,110
I think you are destroying

903
00:39:06,110 --> 00:39:07,320
our friendship.

904
00:39:10,510 --> 00:39:11,320
Of course,

905
00:39:13,030 --> 00:39:14,030
legally speaking,

906
00:39:14,030 --> 00:39:14,920
you are free.

907
00:39:14,920 --> 00:39:16,760
You can quit anytime.

908
00:39:16,760 --> 00:39:18,280
But in order to quit,

909
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:20,230
you made up

910
00:39:20,230 --> 00:39:23,280
such a stupid excuse.

911
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:24,190
I think

912
00:39:24,590 --> 00:39:25,840
you are not only insulting

913
00:39:25,840 --> 00:39:26,920
my intelligence

914
00:39:28,110 --> 00:39:30,320
but also showing no respect

915
00:39:31,710 --> 00:39:32,800
for me.

916
00:39:33,630 --> 00:39:35,110
No, Mr. Wu, I...

917
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:38,070
There were people

918
00:39:38,070 --> 00:39:39,590
who disrespected me before.

919
00:39:39,590 --> 00:39:40,670
But things

920
00:39:40,960 --> 00:39:43,400
didn't end up well

921
00:39:44,360 --> 00:39:45,360
for them.

922
00:39:47,000 --> 00:39:47,880
I'm telling you this

923
00:39:47,880 --> 00:39:49,320
not to scare you.

924
00:39:49,440 --> 00:39:50,920
I just want to tell you that

925
00:39:51,320 --> 00:39:51,960
I am...

926
00:39:54,150 --> 00:39:56,480
a law-abiding businessman.

927
00:39:57,400 --> 00:39:58,320
My men

928
00:39:58,320 --> 00:40:00,190
are smart, but they

929
00:40:01,110 --> 00:40:03,320
can be very impulsive sometimes.

930
00:40:06,800 --> 00:40:07,880
I'm already very busy

931
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:09,230
doing business now.

932
00:40:11,510 --> 00:40:13,310
Don't cause me any more trouble,

933
00:40:13,760 --> 00:40:14,550
okay?

934
00:40:21,630 --> 00:40:22,230
Okay.

935
00:40:34,440 --> 00:40:34,960
Am I getting

936
00:40:34,960 --> 00:40:35,590
a better aura now?

937
00:40:35,590 --> 00:40:35,960
Bravo.

938
00:40:35,960 --> 00:40:36,510
Great.

939
00:40:36,510 --> 00:40:37,030
One more time!

940
00:40:37,030 --> 00:40:37,630
Okay!

941
00:40:51,880 --> 00:40:52,590
Sir,

942
00:40:52,590 --> 00:40:54,840
what does your pain feel like?

943
00:40:54,840 --> 00:40:56,150
Can you describe it?

944
00:40:57,710 --> 00:40:58,840
My whole body hurts.

945
00:40:59,880 --> 00:41:01,360
My arms are tingling.

946
00:41:01,550 --> 00:41:02,800
My legs are sore.

947
00:41:02,800 --> 00:41:03,800
My head is buzzing.

948
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:04,440
And my lower abdomen

949
00:41:04,440 --> 00:41:05,070
sometimes cramps up

950
00:41:05,070 --> 00:41:06,070
and sometimes flutters.

951
00:41:06,070 --> 00:41:08,270
Anyway, I feel uncomfortable all over.

952
00:41:17,580 --> 00:41:18,480
[Emergency Surgery Department]

953
00:41:18,360 --> 00:41:19,260
Liu Zhengliang.

954
00:41:19,260 --> 00:41:24,910
[Wishing You a Speedy Recovery]

955
00:41:19,510 --> 00:41:20,440
Liu Zhengliang.

956
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:23,190
Tell Mr. Long that

957
00:41:23,230 --> 00:41:24,400
I don't want to work at KTV anymore.

958
00:41:24,400 --> 00:41:25,070
I just can't do it.

959
00:41:25,070 --> 00:41:25,840
Get out.

960
00:41:26,230 --> 00:41:28,160
Don't you see I'm seeing a patient?

961
00:41:28,630 --> 00:41:29,550
Sorry, sir.

962
00:41:29,880 --> 00:41:31,000
You can just make a call.

963
00:41:31,000 --> 00:41:31,840
It won't take much time.

964
00:41:31,840 --> 00:41:32,630
Liu!

965
00:41:35,550 --> 00:41:36,360
Sorry, sir.

966
00:41:36,360 --> 00:41:37,400
-It's okay.
-Just a moment.

967
00:41:37,400 --> 00:41:38,150
Let's go.

968
00:41:39,710 --> 00:41:40,510
Yu Ying.

969
00:41:41,880 --> 00:41:42,670
Well,

970
00:41:42,190 --> 00:41:47,350
[Emergency Department–Yellow Zone]

971
00:41:43,320 --> 00:41:44,590
help me get him out.

972
00:41:44,590 --> 00:41:45,550
Maintain order.

973
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:48,080
Sorry, Chief Physician Liu.

974
00:41:49,070 --> 00:41:49,710
It's so hard

975
00:41:49,710 --> 00:41:50,840
to get you to help me!

976
00:41:51,840 --> 00:41:52,590
How about...

977
00:41:52,590 --> 00:41:53,320
Well...

978
00:41:53,960 --> 00:41:55,960
-I'm sorry.
-About what you just said,

979
00:41:55,960 --> 00:41:58,110
could you use Mandarin

980
00:41:58,110 --> 00:41:59,230
to tell me again?

981
00:41:59,360 --> 00:42:00,150
Okay.

982
00:42:00,550 --> 00:42:03,320
Something's wrong with my arms.

983
00:42:04,290 --> 00:42:07,340
[Emergency]

984
00:42:07,450 --> 00:42:10,930
[Xiaoximen Hospital wishes you
good health and a speedy recovery.]

985
00:42:11,020 --> 00:42:11,220
[Nurses' Station]

986
00:42:11,220 --> 00:42:12,440
[Priority for acute stroke patients
and patients aged 80 and older.]

987
00:42:12,500 --> 00:42:12,830
[Nurses' Station]

988
00:42:13,420 --> 00:42:15,860
[Emergency] [Red Zone]

989
00:42:20,230 --> 00:42:21,110
Dr. Liu?

990
00:42:23,920 --> 00:42:24,760
Dr. Liu?

991
00:42:25,190 --> 00:42:26,880
Go rest in the lounge.

992
00:42:27,150 --> 00:42:28,410
I'll take it from here.

993
00:42:31,440 --> 00:42:32,360
What's wrong?

994
00:42:32,710 --> 00:42:34,670
It's only been 2 days.
It shouldn't be this bad.

995
00:42:34,670 --> 00:42:35,480
I'm fine.

996
00:42:35,710 --> 00:42:36,840
I... I probably just

997
00:42:36,840 --> 00:42:39,170
haven't eaten all day
and feel a bit dizzy.

998
00:42:39,590 --> 00:42:41,710
Didn't I make instant noodles
for you tonight?

999
00:42:41,710 --> 00:42:42,920
I had no appetite at that time

1000
00:42:42,920 --> 00:42:43,920
and threw it away.

1001
00:42:45,800 --> 00:42:46,480
Just a moment.

1002
00:42:46,480 --> 00:42:47,610
Where are you going?

1003
00:42:48,280 --> 00:42:49,740
I'm going to figure it out.

1004
00:42:50,840 --> 00:42:52,480
It should be no big deal. Look at you.

1005
00:42:52,480 --> 00:42:53,440
It hurts so much.

1006
00:42:53,630 --> 00:42:54,230
Doctor.

1007
00:42:54,230 --> 00:42:55,360
Come on, sit here.

1008
00:42:55,840 --> 00:42:56,510
Please wait a moment.

1009
00:42:56,510 --> 00:42:57,280
My shift is over.

1010
00:42:57,280 --> 00:42:58,280
Doctor, my wife is having

1011
00:42:58,280 --> 00:42:59,030
no major problems.

1012
00:42:59,030 --> 00:43:00,560
She just has a stomachache.

1013
00:43:00,960 --> 00:43:02,760
It hurts so much that I can't
even think of anything else.

1014
00:43:02,760 --> 00:43:04,760
I feel so uncomfortable, Doctor.

1015
00:43:04,760 --> 00:43:05,820
Is it that serious?

1016
00:43:06,710 --> 00:43:07,510
Honey,

1017
00:43:07,880 --> 00:43:09,280
you have no idea.

1018
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:12,190
Besides the stomachache,

1019
00:43:12,190 --> 00:43:13,360
are there any other symptoms?
